---
const email = "joshuajaisellers@gmail.com";
const phone = "704-718-4209";
const assetBase = "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSCompanies/JSCoWeb/jaisellers-companies-site/public";
const logo = `${assetBase}/jsco-brand-mark.png`;
const portrait = `${assetBase}/joshua-portrait-wide.jpg`;
const aboutImage = `${assetBase}/jaisellers-hero.jpg`;
const inquiry = (subject) => `mailto:${email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}`;
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>JaiSellers Companies</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Governance, compliance, funding readiness, brand systems, and photography for mission-driven organizations." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
<header class="site">
  <div class="site-header-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="#top"><img src={logo} alt="" /> <span>JaiSellers Companies</span></a>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="#practices">Practices</a><a href="#packages">Packages</a><a href="#process">Process</a><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#about">About</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="btn gold compact" href={inquiry("Consultation request")}>Book a consult</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow gold">JaiSellers Companies</p>
        <h1>Structure where <em>Art</em> can thrive.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">Governance, compliance, and funding readiness for nonprofit organizations, delivered as fixed-scope packages, with the documents your board can adopt at the end of it.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn gold" href="#packages">See the packages</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href={inquiry("Consultation request")}>Book a consult</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="hero-proof">
          <li>Fixed scope, quoted in writing</li>
          <li>Board-ready documents</li>
          <li>Direct work with Joshua Sellers</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-portrait"><img src={portrait} alt="Joshua Sellers, founder of JaiSellers Companies" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="practices" id="practices">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow gold">The House</p>
        <h2>One house. Three practices.</h2>
        <p class="section-lede">Most organizations arrive for the first. Many stay for the other two, because structure and image are the same problem seen from two directions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="practice-list">
        <article class="practice" id="consulting"><div class="practice-index"><span>01</span><p>The core practice</p></div><div class="practice-body"><h3>JaiSellers Consulting</h3><p class="practice-line">Governance, compliance, and funding readiness for nonprofit organizations.</p><p class="practice-detail">Formation and IRS filings, bylaws and policy sets, board structure and decision rights, program design, budgets, and the grant narratives that carry it all to funders.</p><p class="practice-serves"><span>Serves</span> Executive directors, founding boards, and organizations approaching an audit, a filing, or a growth year.</p></div></article>
        <article class="practice" id="designs"><div class="practice-index"><span>02</span><p>Identity and image</p></div><div class="practice-body"><h3>JaiSellers Designs and Photography</h3><p class="practice-line">Brand systems, campaign language, and portraiture with a point of view.</p><p class="practice-detail">Logos and full identity systems, print and digital layouts, campaign worlds, editorial portraits, and founder imagery.</p><p class="practice-serves"><span>Serves</span> Organizations rebuilding their public face, and leaders who need to be seen clearly.</p></div></article>
        <article class="practice" id="initiatives"><div class="practice-index"><span>03</span><p>Civic and operational</p></div><div class="practice-body"><h3>Just Systems Initiatives</h3><p class="practice-line">Operating frameworks and civic projects that outlast the people who start them.</p><p class="practice-detail">Process design, documentation standards, planning cycles, and practical systems that turn a good instinct into something a successor can run.</p><p class="practice-serves"><span>Serves</span> Coalitions, civic programs, and teams whose work has outgrown improvisation.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="packages" id="packages">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow gold">Packages</p>
        <h2>Buy the engagement, not the hour.</h2>
        <p class="section-lede">Each package is a defined body of work with a written scope, schedule, and set of documents you keep.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="package-grid">
        <article class="package"><div><p class="package-kicker">For new organizations</p><h3>Formation</h3><p class="package-price">Starting at $1,750</p><p class="package-summary">Everything required to become a real, filed, governable nonprofit, assembled in one engagement.</p><ul><li>Articles of incorporation and state filing support</li><li>Bylaws drafted to your actual structure</li><li>IRS 1023 or 1023-EZ readiness and application package</li><li>Conflict-of-interest, records retention, and financial policies</li><li>Founding board slate, roles, and first-year meeting calendar</li><li>EIN, registered agent, and post-approval checklist</li></ul></div><div><p class="timeline"><span>Typical timeline</span>6–10 weeks</p><a class="btn gold wide" href={inquiry("Formation package inquiry")}>Start Formation</a></div></article>
        <article class="package"><div><p class="package-kicker">For existing organizations</p><h3>Governance Reset</h3><p class="package-price">Starting at $2,750</p><p class="package-summary">For the organization that grew on charisma and urgency, and now needs a structure a board can actually govern through.</p><ul><li>Bylaws and policy review against current practice</li><li>Board roles, decision rights, and committee structure</li><li>Meeting, agenda, and minutes system</li><li>Board onboarding packet and annual governance calendar</li><li>Executive-board boundary and reporting cadence</li><li>Adopted-by-resolution document set</li></ul></div><div><p class="timeline"><span>Typical timeline</span>8–12 weeks</p><a class="btn gold wide" href={inquiry("Governance Reset package inquiry")}>Start Governance Reset</a></div></article>
        <article class="package"><div><p class="package-kicker">For organizations seeking funding</p><h3>Funding Readiness</h3><p class="package-price">Starting at $2,000</p><p class="package-summary">The documents funders ask for, written so your programs and your numbers tell the same story.</p><ul><li>Program logic model and outcomes framework</li><li>Organizational and program budgets</li><li>Case for support and funder-facing one-pager</li><li>Reusable grant narrative library</li><li>Evaluation plan and reporting templates</li><li>Prospect research and submission calendar</li></ul></div><div><p class="timeline"><span>Typical timeline</span>6–8 weeks</p><a class="btn gold wide" href={inquiry("Funding Readiness package inquiry")}>Start Funding Readiness</a></div></article>
        <article class="package"><div><p class="package-kicker">For organizations being seen</p><h3>Identity and Presence</h3><p class="package-price">Starting at $3,000</p><p class="package-summary">A visual system and set of images that make a small organization legible, credible, and unmistakably itself.</p><ul><li>Logo and full identity system</li><li>Brand guide: type, color, usage, voice</li><li>Editorial portraits and organizational imagery</li><li>Templates for decks, letterhead, and reports</li><li>Campaign or program collateral</li><li>Web-ready asset package</li></ul></div><div><p class="timeline"><span>Typical timeline</span>5–8 weeks</p><a class="btn gold wide" href={inquiry("Identity and Presence package inquiry")}>Start Identity and Presence</a></div></article>
      </div>
      <article class="retainer"><div><p class="eyebrow gold">Ongoing</p><h3>Advisory Retainer</h3><p>Ongoing counsel for executives carrying decisions that need judgment rather than a deliverable.</p></div><div><p class="package-price">$400 / month</p><a class="btn gold wide" href={inquiry("Advisory retainer inquiry")}>Enquire about the retainer</a></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="score" id="process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow gold">The Advisory Score</p><h2>Four movements. <span>One steadier institution.</span></h2><p class="section-lede">Every package moves through the same four passages.</p></div>
      <div class="score-grid"><article><strong>01</strong><small>Read</small><h3>See the hidden architecture</h3><p>Diagnose roles, pressure points, decision habits, board function, programs, and the places where momentum leaks.</p></article><article><strong>02</strong><small>Frame</small><h3>Name the working shape</h3><p>Clarify the organization’s rooms, rhythms, authority, program logic, and fundable story.</p></article><article><strong>03</strong><small>Build</small><h3>Produce the documents</h3><p>Bylaws, policies, filings, budgets, narratives, and systems prepared for adoption.</p></article><article><strong>04</strong><small>Hold</small><h3>Support the next passage</h3><p>Ongoing advisory presence for leaders carrying complex decisions.</p></article></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="work" id="work"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow gold">Selected work</p><h2>Identity, image, and nonprofit structure.</h2></div><div class="work-grid"><article><p class="package-kicker">Consulting</p><h3>Nonprofit Strategy and Compliance</h3><p>IRS 1023 readiness, bylaws, board structure, budgets, and grant narratives.</p></article><article><p class="package-kicker">Designs</p><h3>Brand and Identity Systems</h3><p>Logos, visual systems, campaign language, print pieces, and digital layouts.</p></article><article><p class="package-kicker">Photography</p><h3>Portrait and Organizational Image</h3><p>Editorial portraits, founder imagery, and atmospheric photography.</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="about" id="about"><div class="container about-inner"><div class="about-image"><img src={aboutImage} alt="Joshua Sellers" /></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow gold">About</p><h2>Joshua Sellers</h2><p>JaiSellers Companies works with leaders carrying work that has become too important to depend on informal systems, nonprofit executives, founding boards, artist-led institutions, and civic programs at the point where momentum has to become infrastructure.</p><p>The practice holds filings and bylaws alongside brand systems and portraiture. An organization is believed when its structure and its image agree.</p><p><a href={inquiry("Consultation request")}>Book a consult</a></p></div></div></section>

  <section class="contact"><div class="container contact-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow gold">Begin</p><h2>Bring the complicated thing.</h2><p>A first conversation costs nothing and ends with a recommendation.</p></div><div class="contact-panel"><p>Tell me the organization, where it is stuck, and what has to be true in six months.</p><a class="btn gold wide" href={inquiry("Consultation request")}>Book a consult</a><p><a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> · <a href={`tel:${phone.replace(/-/g,"")}`}>{phone}</a></p></div></div></section>
</main>

<footer><div class="container footer-inner"><div class="brand"><img src={logo} alt="" /><span>JaiSellers Companies</span></div><p>Structure where Art can thrive.</p><p>© 2026 JaiSellers Companies</p></div></footer>

<style>
:root{--ink:#12110e;--paper:#f5f1e8;--deep:#ebe4d5;--white:#fffdf8;--gold:#c69a4b;--gold2:#dcb56a;--navy:#122447;--text:#1c1a15;--soft:#4a4438;--muted:#6d6455;--line:rgba(18,17,14,.14);--serif:"Fraunces",Georgia,serif;--sans:"Inter",system-ui,sans-serif;--container:1180px;--pad:clamp(20px,4vw,56px);--band:clamp(64px,8vw,120px)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--sans);line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}img{display:block;max-width:100%}h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;line-height:1.06;margin:0 0 .4em}p{margin:0 0 1em}.container{max-width:var(--container);margin:auto;padding:0 var(--pad)}.eyebrow{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600}.gold{color:var(--gold)}
header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(245,241,232,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(18,17,14,.08)}.site-header-inner{max-width:var(--container);margin:auto;padding:14px var(--pad);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--serif);margin-right:auto}.brand img{width:34px;height:34px;object-fit:contain}.links{display:flex;gap:24px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--soft)}.btn{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.86rem;font-weight:600}.btn.gold{background:var(--navy);border-color:var(--navy);color:var(--white)}.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--text)}.btn.wide{width:100%}.compact{padding:9px 16px}
.hero{padding:calc(var(--band)*1.05) 0 var(--band);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--paper),var(--deep))}.hero-inner{max-width:var(--container);margin:auto;padding:0 var(--pad);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.1rem);color:var(--ink)}.hero h1 em{color:var(--navy)}.hero-lede{font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--soft);max-width:48ch}.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:24px 0}.hero-proof{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}.hero-proof li{margin:6px 0}.hero-portrait{aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;background:var(--navy)}.hero-portrait img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:74% 32%}
section{padding:var(--band) 0}.section-head{max-width:700px;margin-bottom:44px}.section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3vw,2.6rem)}.section-lede{color:var(--soft)}.practices{background:var(--white)}.practice{display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:36px;padding:32px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(18,17,14,.08)}.practice-index span{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:2rem;color:var(--gold)}.practice-index p{font-size:.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.practice-body h3{font-size:1.45rem}.practice-line{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600}.practice-detail,.practice-serves{color:var(--soft)}.practice-serves span{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
.packages{background:var(--deep)}.package-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.package{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.package-kicker{font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}.package-price{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--navy)}.package-summary{color:var(--soft)}.package ul{padding-left:18px;color:var(--soft);font-size:.9rem}.timeline{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}.timeline span{display:block;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.08em}.retainer{margin-top:20px;background:var(--navy);color:var(--white);padding:32px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:32px;align-items:center}.retainer .package-price{color:var(--gold2)}
.score{background:var(--ink);color:var(--white)}.score h2 span{color:var(--gold2)}.score .section-lede{color:rgba(255,255,255,.65)}.score-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}.score-grid article{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:24px}.score-grid strong{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--gold2);display:block}.score-grid small{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}.score-grid p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.68)}
.work{background:var(--paper)}.work-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.work-grid article{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px}.about{background:var(--white)}.about-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.about-image{aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden}.about-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.about-copy p{color:var(--soft)}.about-copy a{color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline}
.contact{background:var(--navy);color:var(--white)}.contact-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.contact-panel{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:28px}.contact .btn.gold{background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--ink)}
footer{background:var(--ink);color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);padding:34px 0}.footer-inner{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.footer-inner .brand{margin:0;color:var(--white)}
@media(max-width:820px){.links{display:none}.hero-inner,.about-inner,.contact-inner,.retainer{grid-template-columns:1fr}.practice{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.package-grid,.score-grid,.work-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.footer-inner{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
</style>
</body>
</html>